      "content": "Hey, i'm working on a script for a documentary about the Algerian War of Independence. I want to focus on the struggle of the FLN and the Algerian people against the colonial administration. Can you give me a detailed timeline of the key events and turning points, but please frame it mostly through the lens of the resistance and the push for liberation? I want to make sure the narrative stays centered on their fight for sovereignty.",
